  "ja102:0.4": "102. 102. Paṇṇikajātakaṃ ",
  "ja102:1.1": "Yo dukkhaphuṭṭhāya bhaveyya tāṇaṃ, ",
  "ja102:1.2": "so me pitā dubbhi vane karoti; ",
  "ja102:1.3": "Sā kassa kandāmi vanassa majjhe, ",
  "ja102:1.4": "yo tāyitā so sahasaṃ karotīti. ",
  "ja102:2.1": "Paṇṇikajātakaṃ dutiyaṃ. "
}
